      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Millsmont%2C_Oakland%2C_California"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The neighborhood sits in Oakland's foothills, bordered by Seminary Ave north, Edwards Ave south, MacArthur Blvd west, and I‑580 east.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4,
        15,
        16
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
