    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "After the 1906 earthquake, many displaced San Franciscans settled on small plots in Millsmont, later expanding their homes.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10,
        27,
        28
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Millsmont%2C_Oakland%2C_California"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "In the early 1900s, buyers could purchase a quarter‑acre plot with building plans and materials for about $500, and most houses were one‑bedroom designs.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
